Overall Net-Zero Target: Breedon Group plc commits to reach net-zero greenhouse gas emissions across the value chain by 2050. Near-Term Targets: Breedon Group plc commits to reduce absolute gross scope 1, 2 and scope 3 GHG emissions from purchased clinker and cement 23.3% by 2030 from a 2022 base year. *
Within this target;
Breedon Group plc commits to reduce gross scope 1 GHG emissions from cementitious product production 18.6% per tonne within the same timeframe*;
Breedon Group plc commits to reduce gross scope 2 GHG emissions from cementitious product production 55.3% per tonne within the same timeframe;
Breedon Group plc commits to reduce all other absolute scope 1 and 2 GHG emissions 42% within the same timeframe*;
Breedon Group plc commits to reduce gross scope 3 GHG emissions from purchased goods and services 21.0% per tonne of purchased clinker and cement within the same timeframe. *
*The target boundary includes land-related emissions and removals from bioenergy feedstocks. Long-Term Targets: Breedon Group plc commits to reduce absolute gross scope 1, 2 and 3 GHG emissions 95% by 2050 from a 2022 base year.*  *The target boundary includes land-related emissions and removals from bioenergy feedstocks.
